---
// The site footer. The four-column version (02-structure.md §1) arrives with the docs pages in M1.
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="site-frame footer__inner">
    <p class="footer__line">DBM System is open source under the MIT licence. The fonts keep their own licence (SIL Open Font License).</p>
    <nav aria-label="Project">
      <ul class="footer__links">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/designsbymason/dbm-system">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@dbm-system/components">npm</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/designsbymason/dbm-system/issues">Issues</a></li>
        <li><a href="/storybook/">Storybook</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--site-rule);
    padding-block: var(--dbm-space-10);
    font-size: var(--dbm-font-size-sm);
    color: var(--site-graphite);
  }
  .footer__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--dbm-space-4);
  }
  .footer__line {
    margin: 0;
    max-inline-size: 40em;
  }
  .footer__links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--dbm-space-5);
  }
  .footer a {
    color: var(--site-ink);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
  .footer a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--dbm-border-focus);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: var(--dbm-radius-xs);
  }
</style>
